  "about_creator_title": "Who am I?",
  "about_creator_body": "I'm Fizzey, a competitive Pokémon Unite player and passionate web developer. An active member of the French esport scene, I created Unite Tools to fill the gap in quality tools for our community.<br><br>My goal: make competitive resources accessible to everyone in the same place, for free, without compromising on quality.",
